# FAI.EV.ENGINEER — Complete 5-Stage System Architecture Blueprint

### Comprehensive Stage-by-Stage Visual Architecture & Workflow Specification

This master document breaks down the complete architecture of **`FAI.EV.ENGINEER`** into 5 distinct, crystal-clear stage blueprints matching the enterprise multi-tenant SaaS architecture.

---

## 🔐 STAGE 1: Multi-Tenant Enterprise Auth & Edge Gateway Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph Zone1 ["Zone 1: Public Internet & Subdomain Ingress"]
        Subdomain["🌐 Tenant Entrypoint\nhttps://{tenant_slug}.faiev.engineer"]
        WAF["🛡️ Cloudflare Enterprise WAF\n(DDoS Mitigation & TLS 1.3 Termination)"]
        Ingress["☸️ NGINX Ingress Controller\n(mTLS Routing & Token Bucket Rate Limiting)"]
    end

    subgraph Zone2 ["Zone 2: Edge Authentication & Session Verification"]
        EdgeAuth["⚡ Next.js Edge Auth Middleware"]
        RedisSession[("⚡ Redis Enterprise Session Cache\n(Sub-2ms JWT Lookup)")]
    end

    subgraph Zone3 ["Zone 3: Multi-Tenant Identity Providers"]
        ResendMagic["📬 Resend API Engine\n(Passwordless Email Magic Links)"]
        SAMLJackson["🛡️ SAML 2.0 Jackson Proxy\n(Okta / Azure AD Enterprise SSO)"]
        OAuth2["🔑 OAuth2 Providers\n(Google Workspace & Microsoft 365)"]
    end

    subgraph Zone4 ["Zone 4: Application Context & RLS Isolation"]
        AuthGateway["🔐 NextAuth.js v5 / Better-Auth Gateway"]
        PrismaMiddleware["⚙️ Prisma Tenant Context Middleware\n(Injects SET LOCAL app.current_tenant_id)"]
        PostgresRLS[("🐘 AWS Aurora PostgreSQL\n(Row-Level Security Tenant Isolation)")]
    end

    Subdomain --> WAF --> Ingress --> EdgeAuth
    EdgeAuth <-->|Sub-2ms Token Verification| RedisSession
    EdgeAuth --> AuthGateway

    ResendMagic & SAMLJackson & OAuth2 --> AuthGateway
    AuthGateway <--> RedisSession
    AuthGateway --> PrismaMiddleware --> PostgresRLS
```

### Stage 1 Execution Flow:
1. **Subdomain Resolution:** The client accesses their dedicated tenant URL (`acme.faiev.engineer`).
2. **Edge Interception:** Next.js Edge Auth Middleware checks the session JWT against **Redis** in $< 2\text{ ms}$.
3. **Multi-Tenant SSO / Magic Link:** Unauthenticated users log in via **Resend Magic Links** or enterprise **SAML 2.0 (Okta/Azure AD)**.
4. **Database RLS Context:** Every API request injects the `tenant_id` into the PostgreSQL session, enforcing strict database Row-Level Security.

