## 📬 STAGE 5: Data Persistence, SHA-256 Audit Ledger & AS9102 Resend Export Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    ApprovedPackage["✅ Validated Inspection Package"]
    
    subgraph Persistence_Subnet ["1. Database & Ledger Subnet"]
        PgBouncer["🔄 PgBouncer Pooler"]
        AuroraDB[("🐘 AWS Aurora PostgreSQL\n+ PostGIS Spatial Indexing")]
        SHA256Ledger["🔒 Cryptographic SHA-256 Audit Ledger\n(Hash_n = SHA256(Hash_n-1 + User + Payload))"]
    end

    subgraph Export_Subnet ["2. AS9102 Compiler Engine"]
        Compiler["⚙️ Compliance Compiler Engine\n(OpenPyXL & PyMuPDF)"]
        Form1["Form 1: Part Accountability (.xlsx)"]
        Form2["Form 2: Product Accountability (.xlsx)"]
        Form3["Form 3: Characteristic Accountability (.xlsx)"]
        MarkedPDF["Marked-Up Vector PDF Blueprint"]
        CSVExport["Raw CSV Export"]
    end

    subgraph Dispatch_Subnet ["3. Storage & Transactional Email"]
        S3Storage[("☁️ AWS S3 Storage Bucket")]
        ResendAPI["📬 Resend Email API Engine\n(Dispatches Presigned Download Links)"]
        UserInbox["📥 Quality Team Email Inbox"]
    end

    ApprovedPackage --> PgBouncer --> AuroraDB & SHA256Ledger
    ApprovedPackage --> Compiler
    Compiler --> Form1 & Form2 & Form3 & MarkedPDF & CSVExport
    Form1 & Form2 & Form3 & MarkedPDF & CSVExport --> S3Storage
    SHA256Ledger & S3Storage --> ResendAPI --> UserInbox
```

### Stage 5 Execution Flow:
1. **Validation & Locking:** The Quality Engineer signs off on the validated package.
2. **Cryptographic SHA-256 Ledger:** The edit chain is sealed with an immutable cryptographic SHA-256 hash node.
3. **AS9102 Excel & PDF Compilation:** The compiler generates official Form 1, Form 2, and Form 3 `.xlsx` workbooks and a marked-up vector PDF.
4. **Resend Email Delivery:** Certified artifacts are uploaded to AWS S3, and **Resend API** dispatches presigned download links directly to the team's inboxes.
